# This file is the codeowners-plus equivalent of .github/CODEOWNERS, used by
# the multimediallc/codeowners-plus GitHub Action.
#
# Trial setup: this file lives alongside the existing .github/CODEOWNERS for
# now. Native CODEOWNERS continues to gate merges; codeowners-plus runs as a
# parallel, non-required check so people can evaluate it without it blocking
# anything.
#
# Syntax differences from CODEOWNERS:
#   - Rules are relative to this file's directory (repo root here).
#   - Leading '/' is ignored.
#   - Trailing '/' auto-expands to '/**'.
#   - '*' does not cross path separators; use '**/x' for "anywhere in the tree".
#   - '& path @owner' adds an AND-required reviewer in addition to the file owner.
#   - '? path @owner' adds an optional (cc'd, non-blocking) reviewer.
# See https://github.com/multimediallc/codeowners-plus for the full spec.

.editorconfig                                       @consensys-test/release-team @HowardBraham
ui/layouts/require-authenticated.tsx                @consensys-test/release-team @HowardBraham
